I've deliberately left any tracking or "stats" stats off the site. I don't need to know how people are using the list. It's fairly simple, analytics wouldn't add anything to this.

@nylen can you confirm if we have anything via Netlify which adds analytics? 

If not, I'd like to add a simple page which says "we don't track you, yo. that's why we don't have a Cookies banner"
